n = 21). In the first 2 weeks the daily doses were 50 mg AMI or 2 mg FLU, respectively, from the third week on up to the
sixth week 100 mg AMI and 4 mg FLU. Clinical evaluations, psychometry and EEG mapping were performed on day 1 (hours 0 
and 4 – acute effect), on day 14 (hour 0 – subacute effect) and on day 42 (hours 0 and 4 – chronic and superimposed 
